    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;lie and unnecessary.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a boy who overslept while riding the water monorail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is woken up in an unknown location by an announcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he heads to the entrance, there's only one humanoid conductor there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to her, this is an unmanned observation deck on the water, and it is impossible to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also informs him that the next monorail train is 45 hours away, leaving him at a loss as to what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is divided into two parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story part, the scenario progresses through conversations with characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the commentary part, you can read about the history surrounding the art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;lie and unnecessary.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a boy who overslept while riding the water monorail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is woken up in an unknown location by an announcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he heads to the entrance, there's only one humanoid conductor there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to her, this is an unmanned observation deck on the water, and it is impossible to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also informs him that the next monorail train is 45 hours away, leaving him at a loss as to what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is divided into two parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story part, the scenario progresses through conversations with characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the commentary part, you can read about the history surrounding the art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>",
